-- WoW Forever random suffixes ("of the Eagle", "of Magic", "of Fire Protection", "of the Sorcerer", ...): each item now rolls from its
-- own pool in the client's tables, as live does, instead of the vanilla random property groups (2026_10_08_00). The client
-- 1.60.1.70959 links every random-suffix item to one bonus tree (ItemXBonusTree), whose nodes are the suffix bonus lists
-- (ItemBonusTreeNode -> ItemBonus: stat shares and the suffix name). Forever's pools hold the new suffixes (of Magic, of X
-- Protection, of the Prophet / Physician / Hierophant, of the Sorcerer / Elder / Channeler, of Holy Wrath, of the Beast, of the
-- Champion) and drop the old "of X Resistance" suffixes; the school wrath suffixes stay only in the pools whose tree has them.
-- How the server picks a suffix: GenerateItemRandomBonusListId (ItemEnchantmentMgr.cpp) rolls a weighted entry of the
-- item_random_bonus_list_template group named by item_template_addon.RandomBonusListTemplateId, for loot, quest rewards, vendors,
-- the auction house bot and boosts alike. The client trees are not used directly: ItemBonusMgr::GetBonusListsForItem skips a tree
-- with more than one node for the item's context (CanApplyBonusTreeToItem), which every suffix tree has. So this file writes one
-- group per client tree (group id = the tree id) and points each item at its tree.
-- Weights: the client holds none, so every suffix in a pool is equally likely.
-- Items: the 1,674 items the vanilla file covered (all of them have a client tree) plus 39 more with a client tree and an item
-- row on our realm (the 24 Abyssal Council pieces, which had no suffix and so no stats, Viridian Band, Vermilion Band and
-- Necklace, Ivory Band, Onyx Choker, the seven Forever engineering belts and goggles 280306-280313, Jagged Knives 285282-285284).
-- Left out: the client's test and hidden items (JYoo test items, "Hidden ... (DNT)", "UNUSED") and 31 items with no item row here.
-- MythicSim (MIT) reads the same trees for its 1,684 items; its pools equal these for all of them. Safe to run again.

DELETE FROM `item_random_bonus_list_template`;
UPDATE `item_template_addon` SET `RandomBonusListTemplateId` = 0 WHERE `RandomBonusListTemplateId` <> 0;
ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE `RandomBonusListTemplateId` = VALUES(`RandomBonusListTemplateId`);
